# Mutants for the group, water, lens flare and sound classes of a scene node and the walks into a space graph. Each text occurs exactly once in its file. See docs/verification.md.
#
# Dropped as equivalent, provably:
#  "Water body: no constructor loop": removing AtConstructEach over the patches, whose function is empty. Nothing is written, called or logged either way.
#  "Switch dtor: no clear": the switch group's destructor calls the group's Clear, and the group's destructor, which runs straight after with nothing between, calls the same Clear, which does nothing the second time that the first did not.
#  "Flare read: world radius": FinishBody, which Read always reaches unless it crashes, writes the world radius on every path.
#  "Group body: missing child unreported", "Lod body: missing child unreported": AsActor reports the null and then reads its class through it, so the report after it is never reached here; in the game AtFatal does not return.
#  "Water read: not cleared first": the base's Read asks the same flag and calls the same virtual Clear before anything else, and the water's Clear leaves the flag, so the second call does what the first would have.
